# French texts of the test level. Each line: "original" = "translation".
language fr "Français"

# Weapons
"Short Sword" = "Épée courte"
"A plain blade. The weapon everyone starts with." = "Une lame toute simple. L’arme de tous les débuts."
"Dagger" = "Dague"
"Short and quick." = "Courte et rapide."
"Great Axe" = "Grande hache"
"Slow and heavy; strikes from above as well." = "Lente et lourde ; frappe aussi par le haut."
"Chain Whip" = "Fouet à chaîne"
"Reaches far, a little late." = "Porte loin, un peu tard."
"Throwing Knives" = "Couteaux de lancer"
"Two in the air at most." = "Deux en l’air au plus."
"Flame Brand" = "Lame ardente"
"A short sword that burns what it strikes." = "Une épée courte qui brûle ce qu’elle frappe."

# Spells
"Ember" = "Braise"
"A bolt of fire." = "Un trait de feu."
"Frost Shard" = "Éclat de givre"
"A bolt of ice that freezes what it strikes." = "Un trait de glace qui gèle ce qu’il frappe."
"Ward" = "Égide"
"Halves the harm taken for a while." = "Réduit de moitié les dégâts subis pendant un temps."
"Mend" = "Soin"
"Heals over a short time." = "Soigne en peu de temps."
"Blood Moon" = "Lune de sang"
"Strikes everything around." = "Frappe tout alentour."

# Abilities
"Double Jump" = "Double saut"
"One more jump in the air." = "Un saut de plus en l’air."
"Dash" = "Ruée"
"R: a quick dash." = "R : une ruée rapide."
"Wall Jump" = "Saut mural"
"Slide down walls and jump off them." = "Glisser le long des murs et s’en élancer."
"Ground Pound" = "Frappe au sol"
"Down and B in the air: strike the ground." = "Bas et B en l’air : frapper le sol."
"Second Wind" = "Second souffle"
"Once in every room, a blow that would end you leaves you standing." = "Une fois par salle, un coup fatal vous laisse debout."

# Consumables
"Potion" = "Potion"
"Restores 15 health." = "Rend 15 points de vie."
"Large Potion" = "Grande potion"
"Restores 40 health." = "Rend 40 points de vie."
"Mana Vial" = "Fiole de mana"
"Restores 15 mana." = "Rend 15 points de mana."
"Antidote" = "Antidote"
"Cures poison." = "Guérit le poison."
"Fire Flask" = "Flasque de feu"
"Thrown in an arc; burns where it lands." = "Lancée en arc ; brûle là où elle tombe."
"Return Feather" = "Plume du retour"
"Back to the last save point." = "Retour au dernier point de sauvegarde."

# Armour
"Leather Cap" = "Bonnet de cuir"
"Iron Helm" = "Heaume de fer"
"Traveller's Coat" = "Manteau de voyage"
"What everyone starts with." = "Ce que chacun porte au début."
"Chain Mail" = "Cotte de mailles"
"Strong, and a little slow." = "Solide, et un peu lente."
"Ember Cloak" = "Cape de braise"
"Fire does half the harm." = "Le feu ne fait que la moitié des dégâts."
"Lucky Coin" = "Pièce porte-bonheur"
"Blood Ring" = "Anneau de sang"
"More strength, less life." = "Plus de force, moins de vie."
"Thorn Band" = "Bandeau d’épines"
"What strikes you is struck back." = "Qui vous frappe est frappé en retour."

# Key items
"Coin" = "Pièce"
"Heart" = "Cœur"
"A heart-shaped stone, warm to the touch." = "Une pierre en forme de cœur, tiède au toucher."
"A gold coin." = "Une pièce d’or."
"Key" = "Clé"
"Opens a door somewhere." = "Ouvre une porte quelque part."

