# The moon bat (Vesper keeps her name)
"Who wakes me under the blood moon?" = "Qui me réveille sous la lune de sang ?"
"Stay, then. You will not leave." = "Reste donc. Tu ne repartiras pas."
"The moon... is setting..." = "La lune... se couche..."
